id: SCA-074
title: GitHub Actions GITHUB_TOKEN exposed to workflows
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN
patterns:
  - regex: \$\{\{\s*secrets\.(GITHUB_TOKEN|github_token)\s*\}\}
    message: GITHUB_TOKEN passed explicitly — if used with third-party actions, gives them full API access. Prefer permissions over explicit token passing.
fix: Use permissions to limit GITHUB_TOKEN scope. Pass secrets only to trusted first-party actions. Review what each third-party action does with provided secrets.
